===Etymology===
1538 as noun, 1660 as verb. By reduplication. Perhaps from a dialectical word or Scandinavian; compare Old Norse {{term|flim||[[lampoon]], [[mockery]]|lang=non}}.<ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈflɪmflæm/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[flim]]-[[flam]]}}

